    <headline>Thunderstorm This Afternoon in Jawa Barat</headline>
    <description>Thunderstorms and heavy rainfall are forecasted to occur starting from 05 October 2026, 14:10 WIB in parts of Jawa Barat especially in: ANDIR, ANTAPANI, ARCAMANIK, ARJASARI, ASTANA ANYAR, BABAKAN CIPARAY, BALEENDAH, BANDUNG KIDUL, BANDUNG KULON, BANDUNG WETAN, BANJARAN, BAROS, BATUNUNGGAL, BOJONGLOA KALER, BOJONGLOA KIDUL, BOJONGSOANG, BUAHBATU, CAMPAKA, CAMPAKAMULYA, CANGKUANG, CARINGIN, CIANJUR, CIBEBER, CIBEUNYING KALER, CIBEUNYING KIDUL, CIBEUREUM, CICANTAYAN, CICENDO, CIDADAP, CIKOLE, CILAKU, CILENGKRANG, CILILIN, CIMAHI SELATAN, CIMAHI TENGAH, CIMAHI UTARA, CIMAUNG, CIMENYAN, CIPANAS, CIREUNGHAS, CISAAT, CISARUA, CISOLOK, CISURUPAN, CITAMIANG, CIWIDEY, COBLONG, CUGENANG, DAYEUHKOLOT, GEGERBITUNG, GEKBRONG, GUNUNG GURUH, GUNUNG PUYUH, GUNUNGHALU, KABANDUNGAN, KADUDAMPIT, KALAPANUNGGAL, KATAPANG, KEBONPEDES, KERTASARI, KIARACONDONG, KUTAWARINGIN, LEMBANG, LEMBURSITU, LENGKONG, MANDALAJATI, MARGAASIH, MARGAHAYU, NGAMPRAH, PACET, PAGELARAN, PAMEUNGPEUK, PAMULIHAN, PANGALENGAN, PARAKANSALAK, PARONGPONG, PASIRJAMBU, PASIRKUDA, RANCABALI, RANCASARI, REGOL, RONGGA, SINDANGKERTA, SOREANG, SUKABUMI, SUKAJADI, SUKALARANG, SUKANAGARA, SUKARAJA, SUKASARI, SUMUR BANDUNG, TAKOKAK, TALEGONG, UJUNG BERUNG, WARUDOYONG, WARUNGKONDANG.
 These conditions may lead to reduced visibility, strong winds, and localized flooding.
 The public is strongly advised to remain vigilant during this period, limit outdoor activities, and take all necessary precautions to ensure safety.
 Conditions are expected to gradually improve by 05 October 2026, 16:00 WIB.</description>
